{"name":"Tobi Brown","hex":"#4c221b","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"brown","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A colour like that of chocolate or coffee.","One of the colour balls used in snooker, with a value of 4 points."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Having a brown color/colour.","Gloomy."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/brown"}],"entries":[{"title":"Tobi (given name)","blocks":[{"text":"Tobi is a Yoruba unisex given name. It can be a contraction of several longer terms, including Olutobi, Oluwatobi, Oluwatobiloba. It can also be a name from another culture like Tobit, and from the English culture and a variant of \"Toby\", which has a different meaning from the Yoruba name version also spelled Tobi. Notable people with this given name include:"},{"items":["Tobi (musician), Nigerian-Canadian rapper","Tobi Adebayo-Rowling, English professional footballer","Tobi Adewole, English professional footballer","Tobi Adeyemi, known as Tobi Lou, American rapper","Tobi Brown, known as TBJZL, English YouTuber","Tobi Jnohope, American soccer player","Tobi Lawal, English basketball player","Tobi Osunsanmi, American football player","Tobi Sokolow, American bridge player","Tobi Stoner, Major League Baseball pitcher","Tobi Vail, independent musician"]}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tobi_(given_name)","wikidata":"Q19968409"},{"title":"Brown","blocks":[{"text":"Brown is a color. It can be thought as a darker, typically desaturated shade of orange, and can often be produced by combining red and yellow with another color, namely blue."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ca/Espresso-roasted_coffee_beans.jpg/330px-Espresso-roasted_coffee_beans.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brown","wikidata":"Q47071"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ca/Espresso-roasted_coffee_beans.j